  vendorName: Speculator Spencer
  offerText: That dusty old land deed on your desk is completely worthless. Hand
    it over to me, and I will give you a modest sum of cash right now.
  acceptResultText: You sell the old paper for pocket change. Your desk is slightly
    cleaner.
  rejectResultText: You stubbornly keep the dusty paper, feeling a bit foolish for
    turning down free money.
  acceptedDelayedText: 
  rejectedDelayedText: The city announces a new railroad! That 'worthless' deed you
    kept is suddenly in high demand, and a buyer pays you a massive sum for it!
